contains too much cyclomatic complexity due to deeply nested loops, conditionals, and error handling. The `collect` method in `MapOutputBuffer` is the primary source of the high complexity. I'll refactor it by extracting logic into separate private methods to reduce nested conditions and clarify the control flow. The goal is to reduce structural complexity while preserving behavior.

